---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SavingsPreview from '../components/SavingsPreview.astro';
import GoalIllustration from '../components/GoalIllustration.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Child Savings Lab" description="Free, independent tools and source-linked guides to explore Trump Accounts, 529 plans, and other ways to save for a child. Start with your question.">
  <div class="home-page">
    <section class="home-hero">
      <div class="shell home-hero-grid">
        <div class="home-hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="little-sun" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Big futures. Small beginnings.</div>
          <h1>Their tomorrow.<br />Your <em>first step.</em></h1>
          <p class="lede">You don’t need all the answers to start. Explore clear guides and free tools for saving for a child—from Trump Accounts to 529 plans and beyond.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button" href="#start">Find my starting point <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <a class="home-text-link" href="/tools/child-savings-account-comparison/">Explore account types <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="home-hero-reassurance"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> No sign-up. No child identifiers. Just a place to start.</p>
          <div class="home-hero-footnote"><span class="home-footnote-line" aria-hidden="true"></span> Independent education for adults.<br />Not a government site or personalized financial advice.</div>
        </div>
        <SavingsPreview />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="home-section-heading">
          <div><div class="eyebrow">Start with your question</div><h2 id="start-heading">What’s on your mind?</h2></div>
          <p>Choose one thing to understand today.<br />You can explore the rest as you go.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="question-grid">
          <a class="question-card status-card" href="/tools/trump-account-eligibility-checker/">
            <div class="question-card-top"><span class="question-label">Check the next step</span><GoalIllustration kind="status" /></div>
            <h3>Could my child qualify for the $1,000 pilot?</h3>
            <p>Check account status, activation, and the separate pilot election. Having an account is not the same as receiving the pilot amount.</p>
            <span class="question-cta">Try the status checker <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="question-card growth-card" href="/tools/trump-account-growth-calculator/">
            <div class="question-card-top"><span class="question-label">See the possibilities</span><GoalIllustration kind="growth" /></div>
            <h3>What could $100 a month look like?</h3>
            <p>Explore a Trump Account scenario with family contributions, fees, and different hypothetical returns. No promises—just transparent math.</p>
            <span class="question-cta">Open the growth calculator <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="question-card compare-card" href="/tools/child-savings-account-comparison/">
            <div class="question-card-top"><span class="question-label">Understand the choices</span><GoalIllustration kind="compare" /></div>
            <h3>Which account fits which goal?</h3>
            <p>Compare education savings, custodial accounts, retirement pathways, and disability savings by purpose—not by a sponsored ranking.</p>
            <span class="question-cta">Compare five account types <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-goals" aria-labelledby="goals-heading">
      <div class="shell goals-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">A goal before an account</div>
          <h2 id="goals-heading">There’s more than one way<br />to save for their future.</h2>
          <p>College. A longer-term head start. Support for disability-related needs. Different goals bring different rules, ownership, and trade-offs.</p>
          <a class="home-text-link" href="/tools/child-savings-account-comparison/">See the purpose-first comparison <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="goal-map" role="list" aria-label="Account types to learn about">
          <div role="listitem"><span class="goal-map-symbol" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span><strong>Education</strong><small>Learn about 529 plans</small></span></div>
          <div role="listitem"><span class="goal-map-symbol" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span><strong>Long-term child investing</strong><small>Understand Trump Account restrictions</small></span></div>
          <div role="listitem"><span class="goal-map-symbol" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span><strong>A flexible gift to a child</strong><small>Learn UGMA/UTMA ownership trade-offs</small></span></div>
          <div role="listitem"><span class="goal-map-symbol" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span><strong>Retirement with earned income</strong><small>Understand Custodial Roth IRAs</small></span></div>
          <div role="listitem"><span class="goal-map-symbol" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span><strong>Disability-related expenses</strong><small>Explore ABLE eligibility and qualified uses</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-topic" aria-labelledby="topic-heading">
      <div class="shell topic-panel">
        <div class="topic-intro">
          <span class="topic-tag">In focus: Trump Accounts</span>
          <h2 id="topic-heading">Heard the headlines?<br />Here’s what to check next.</h2>
          <p>Start with account status. Then understand claiming, activation, and the separate $1,000 pilot election—before planning contributions.</p>
          <a class="button" href="/trump-accounts/">Read the plain-English guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <p class="topic-source-date">Rules reviewed October 8, 2026 · Sources linked in each guide</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic-guides">
          <a href="/forms/form-4547-guide/"><span class="guide-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span><strong>Do I still need Form 4547?</strong><small>What auto enrollment changes—and what it doesn’t.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/compare/trump-account-vs-529/"><span class="guide-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span><strong>Trump Account or 529?</strong><small>Compare purpose, control, and withdrawal rules.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/contributions/trump-account-contribution-limits/"><span class="guide-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span><strong>How much can a family contribute?</strong><small>See which contributions share the annual limit.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/employers/trump-account-benefit-guide/"><span class="guide-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span><strong>Could an employer contribute?</strong><small>Questions for HR, payroll, and benefits teams.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-trust" aria-labelledby="trust-heading">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="home-section-heading">
          <div><div class="eyebrow">Clarity you can check</div><h2 id="trust-heading">Less guesswork. More understanding.</h2></div>
          <a class="home-text-link" href="/methodology/">How we work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-grid">
          <div><span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>Follow the source</h3><p>Important rules link to primary government sources. Proposed rules are labeled as proposed.</p><a href="/sources/">Browse the source library →</a></div>
          <div><span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><h3>Keep your details yours</h3><p>Calculator entries stay in your browser. No sign-up, ad trackers, or requests for child identifiers.</p><a href="/privacy/">Read the privacy policy →</a></div>
          <div><span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">≋</span><h3>Know what this is</h3><p>Independent education, not individualized legal, tax, or investment advice. No claimed professional sign-off.</p><a href="/about/">Meet the publication →</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
